{"title":"Rushmore Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eBring the Beauty of a Wild Evergreen Home with the Rushmore Collection\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Rushmore artificial Christmas tree collection from Carol's Christmas Conifers is designed for those who want a tree that feels genuinely wild and naturally grown. With its long, sweeping branches, wide traditional silhouette, and open, airy structure, the Rushmore Fir captures the organic character of a real forest evergreen, \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003ethe kind of tree that looks like it was found in nature.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Rushmore collection is available in both a realistic green finish and a beautifully flocked version, allowing you to choose the look that best suits your holiday style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhy choose the Rushmore?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe Rushmore is the ideal choice for those who love the look of a real, naturally grown Christmas tree with long, reaching branches and an open, spacious silhouette. Unlike denser artificial trees, the Rushmore's airy branch structure lets every \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\" title=\"Christmas Ornaments\"\u003eornament\u003c\/a\u003e, light, and decoration breathe and be seen, creating a display that feels curated and intentional rather than crowded. Its wide, traditional cone shape gives it a commanding presence, and its naturalistic character makes it especially popular among those who want a tree that feels genuinely organic and one-of-a-kind.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eShould I choose the Rushmore Fir or Rushmore Flocked?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Rushmore is available in both green and flocked finishes, each offering a distinct holiday atmosphere.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Rushmore Fir showcases the tree's natural mixed PE and PVC foliage in rich, deep green tones. Its long, open branches and organic structure pair beautifully with warm white lighting, natural wood accents, and classic ornament collections, making it a timeless and versatile choice for traditional holiday decorating.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Rushmore Flock adds a layer of white snow-dusted finish across the same sweeping branch structure, creating a breathtaking wintry effect. The flock settles naturally along the long branches, closely mimicking the look of real snow resting on an outdoor evergreen. It is ideal for those looking to create a serene, winter woodland atmosphere in their home.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Rushmore a realistic Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eYes. The Rushmore is part of our \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/realistic-trees\" title=\"Realistic Artificial Christmas \"\u003erealistic artificial Christmas tree collection\u003c\/a\u003e. Its mixed PE and PVC foliage replicates the texture and natural variation of a real fir tree, while its open branch structure and wide silhouette closely capture the organic character of a naturally grown evergreen. The result is a tree that feels a bit like a traditional artificial Christmas tree as well as something you brought in straight from the forest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Rushmore Fir available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe Rushmore collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eOur pre-lit Rushmore Fir and Flocked artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting that glows beautifully through the tree's open branch structure, casting a warm and natural light throughout the silhouette. With Power Pole Technology, setup is seamless — no tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect, and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the Rushmore Fir easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eYes. The Rushmore is designed for easy setup, reliable long-term use, and convenient after-season storage. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly and its open structure means less time spent shaping and fluffing compared to denser tree styles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to assist during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree protected between holiday seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhen the season ends, the Rushmore Fir disassembles easily and stores neatly in a cool, dry place, preserving its foliage, structure, and overall condition for many seasons to come.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eExplore the full Rushmore collection and find the finish and size that brings the beauty of a wild, natural evergreen into your home this holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"7-5-foot-rushmore-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Rushmore Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Green \/ Unlit","offer_id":41324025610440,"sku":"RUSF-T7.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Rushmorefirnewversion1.png?v=1722013361"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-rushmore-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Rushmore Fir Artificial Christmas Tree 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":41324037636296,"sku":"RUSF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RushmoreFir.png?v=1722013356"},{"product_id":"9-foot-rushmore-fir-tree-unlit","title":"9' Rushmore Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Green \/ Unlit","offer_id":41324041699528,"sku":"RUSF-T9-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Rushmorefirnewversion1_28ceea28-4758-4fee-9ed4-3658c326b47b.png?v=1722013363"},{"product_id":"9-foot-rushmore-fir-tree-led","title":"9' Rushmore Fir Artificial Christmas Tree 1000 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":41324048810184,"sku":"RUSF-T9-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RushmoreFir_fe27b490-2118-4102-a560-b317260f5439.png?v=1722013358"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-rushmore-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Rushmore Flock Artificial Christmas Tree 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Flock \/ LED","offer_id":41404937994440,"sku":"RUSFLOCK-T7.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RushmoreFlockLED.jpg?v=1723214362"},{"product_id":"9-foot-rushmore-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Rushmore Flock Artificial Christmas Tree 1000 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Flock \/ LED","offer_id":41404942581960,"sku":"RUSFLOCK-T9-L","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RushmoreFlockLED_33cc8cb4-ae56-42fb-8084-561ddbdabab7.jpg?v=1723214406"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Rushmore_a06060b6-6025-4f55-aa0d-9fd2f997bc32.jpg?v=1765555003","url":"/\/collections\/rushmore-trees.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}